# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions for the linux-clang-asan preset
# (plan H1). Only reports inside third-party code belong here, each with the
# reason. Reports in our own code are bugs: fix them instead.

# OCCT's NCollection lists allocate their nodes from NCollection_IncAllocator,
# which aligns to 4 bytes on this build, and the header's inline accessors
# then downcast to node types that want 8. Instantiated in our translation
# units, but OCCT's code and allocation.
alignment:NCollection_TListNode.hxx
